ogram we could find that runs at the school, picks children up from it, or sits within a short walk. Pick a grade to see what your child can join.","5f78638ff3":"{school} is your school","8e61f8375e":"Make this your school","773b251885":"One tap. The home page, every list and your week then start here.","1d7e985c8a":"Who’s open that day","8a300b908c":"Days off this year, and who’s open","9e62d36196":"This week at {school}","82909c56bf":"Looking for a particular program?","40d1d6bf3c":"Places are put on the map from their street address. The map’s pictures come from OpenStreetMap.","1062db6083":"What that means for your privacy.","bc2762bf17":"The number under each grade counts programs at the school or with pickup.","883a11e036":"Nothing matches that. Know a program that should be listed?","c85d669959":"Tell us about it.","340a874bce":"Can’t decide? Let a theme pick for you.","0eccefea65":"Roll a themed week for {school}","4e3deb80a9":"Know a program that serves {school} and isn’t here?","ec70686841":"Add it to the list.","00cef91e6c":"Days off and sign-ups at the programs that serve it, a week at a time. A school’s own dates show here only when a parent sends one in, so go by what the school sends home.","a2b6716f82":"This coming week","19f3511e0a":"from a parent","e9ba1e21ea":"The week after","f944470565":"Want this on Sunday mornings?","00b725fb3f":"It’s an email you turn on in your account, and it only comes in weeks with something out of the ordinary.","cc4d3c366c":"Turn it on","306a184287":"Know a date that’s missing?","89511a76c8":"What is it?","b2028cfcc7":"When?","f65e35cf32":"Anything else? (optional)","41882a4420":"Your email (optional)","855e003f35":"Only used to ask you a question about it. Please leave out children’s names.","c4a3b42095":"Send it","49776b2f15":"We read each one before it goes on the page.","620043a25b":"Get {school} dates by email","b7f02548f1":"Sign-up openings and deadlines for these programs, and a heads-up before each day off.","9c